cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Physics-informed reconstruction of missing intervals in Martian radio-occultation profiles"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark of twelve methods, including physics-informed neural networks that enforce the ideal-gas
  law and hydrostatic balance, for reconstructing missing intervals in MRO Radio Science
  temperature-pressure profiles of the Martian atmosphere.
authors:
